# ==== ACCOUNT APPLICATION ====

# Trainer Register
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/account/trainer/register/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"Sajulal",
    "email":"saju@gmail.com",
    "password":"saju@123",
    "phone":"9876786776"
}

# Trainer Token Genrating
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/account/trainer/loggin/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"Sajulal",
    "password":"saju@123"
}

